'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\14 - Delete Users
' Version    : 4.7.0 DRAFT  (libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents + BulkRegDelete)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegDelete (BR_RunDeleteUsers).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: first create the library BulkRegDelete (BulkRegDelete.lss). Then open this agent,
'              click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this WHOLE file, Ctrl+S.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegDelete.lss header and SOP-delete-failed-users.md):
'
' Deletes the UNREGISTERED Person documents listed in a CSV (columns NoteID, Include=Y) through AdminP DeleteUser,
' including the mail file (all replicas) when it is provably the user's own and nearly empty. Registered users are never
' deleted. DryRun=1 (default) writes the plan only. DryRun=0 needs the word DELETEUSERS and writes a DXL snapshot of
' each Person document first. Not compiled or run against Domino: pilot with 3 to 5 test users.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegDelete"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunDeleteUsers()
End Sub
